# Presetpunk & Scopepunk

- **Presetpunk** lives in `faderpunk-preset-editor/` (brand h1: Presetpunk).
- **Scopepunk** lives in `faderpunk-diagnostics/`.
- Canonical home: https://github.com/kosmar/faderpunk-tools (or branches on https://github.com/kosmar/faderpunk).
- **Never** open a PR against `ATOVproject/faderpunk` for either app.
- **Never** open, edit, or `move_agent_to_root` into `faderpunk-scenes` or `~/Projects/_archived/faderpunk-scenes`.
